  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tBookkeeping\n\t\tBookkeeping Help Guide\n\n### Editing Purchase Invoices\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Fri, 1 Mar, 2024 at 12:28 PM\n\n\t\tThere are 2 cases for editing purchase invoices:\n\n(1) In the case of credit purchases\n\n(2)  In the case of cash purchases\n\nTo edit the credit purchases:\n\nNavigate to Bookkeeping>>Purchase>>Purchases>>Action-drop-down>>Edit.\n\nTo edit the cash purchases:\n\nWe can edit the cash purchase transaction only if we delete the payment transaction. For deleting the payment transaction, please navigate to:\n\nBookkeeping>>Bank>>Dashboard>>Select the bank account (or) Cash in Hand account>>Action drop-down>>delete.\n\nNow we can edit the transaction by navigating to Bookkeeping>>Purchase>>Purchases>>Action-drop-down>>Edit.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115344\">Bookkeeping</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000185558\">Bookkeeping Help Guide</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">Editing Purchase Invoices\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Fri, 1 Mar, 2024 at 12:28 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.295; margin-bottom: 8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">There are 2 cases for editing purchase invoices:</span></p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; margin-left: 1.9pt;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.295; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">(1) In the case of credit purchases</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; margin-left: 1.9pt;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.295; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">(2) &nbsp;In the case of cash purchases</span></p></li></ul><p><br></p><ol style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.295; margin-bottom: 8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">To edit the credit purchases:</span></p></li></ol><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.295; margin-bottom: 8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Navigate to Bookkeeping&gt;&gt;Purchase&gt;&gt;Purchases&gt;&gt;Action-drop-down&gt;&gt;Edit.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.295; margin-bottom: 8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"border:none;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:624px;height:287px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9206712503/original/V0YJTYWW6wbAt1WD_9iLpfmCbKXFdwscwA.png?1709296023\" width=\"624\" height=\"287\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9206712503\"></span></span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><ol start=\"2\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.295; margin-bottom: 8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">To edit the cash purchases:</span></p></li></ol><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.295; margin-bottom: 8pt;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">We can edit the cash purchase transaction only if we delete the payment transaction. For deleting the payment transaction, please navigate to:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.295; margin-bottom: 8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Bookkeeping&gt;&gt;Bank&gt;&gt;Dashboard&gt;&gt;Select the bank account (or) Cash in Hand account&gt;&gt;Action drop-down&gt;&gt;delete.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.295; margin-bottom: 8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"border:none;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:623px;height:291px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9206712502/original/lFyPpHhqnpgOPX4YjJo1OEqbaEQNCLYhvw.png?1709296023\" width=\"623\" height=\"291\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9206712502\"></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.295; margin-bottom: 8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Now we can edit the transaction by navigating to Bookkeeping&gt;&gt;Purchase&gt;&gt;Purchases&gt;&gt;Action-drop-down&gt;&gt;Edit.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.295; margin-bottom: 8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"border:none;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:624px;height:304px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9206712504/original/QROgNh4GAp8yHLSEo0Cotpouhir0iAtSPA.png?1709296023\" width=\"624\" height=\"304\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9206712504\"></span></span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.295; margin-bottom: 8pt;\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.295; margin-bottom: 8pt;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.